<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks for your interest in Arizona State University’s Walter Cronkite School of Journalism and Mass Communication.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">We’re very excited to share more information about our <a href="http://sportsjournalism.jmc.asu.edu/">new sports journalism degrees</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">The Cronkite School has a robust sports journalism program at both the undergraduate and graduate levels. Our program’s foundation is founded in academic curriculum, professional experiences and location.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">We’re based in the heart of Phoenix, a major metropolitan city, with access to a number of professional sporting venues for our students to cover. Not only is Phoenix a hub for MLB Spring Training each year, but we are also one of a handful of U.S. cities that has five major sports teams: MLB, NBA, NFL, NHL and WNBA.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">The Cronkite School has established sports bureaus in both <a href="http://sportsjournalism.jmc.asu.edu/phoenix-sports-bureau.php">Phoenix </a>and <a href="http://sportsjournalism.jmc.asu.edu/los-angeles-sports-bureau.php">Los Angeles</a>, offering students semester-long experiences covering professional teams for various partners like MLB.com and the Pac-12 Network.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Learn more about the Cronkite School’s <a href="https://cronkite.asu.edu/undergrad/admissions">undergraduate admission requirements</a>, and explore our <a href="https://cronkite.asu.edu/professional-programs">11 professional programs</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">We also encourage you to check out <a href="https://vimeo.com/121480315">Experience Cronkite Sports</a>, a sports program featurette produced by our students.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">For more information about the Cronkite School, please call me at {!User.Phone}.</div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Walter Cronkite School of Journalism and Mass Communication</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>